        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PCT350, Traditional Decorative Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's Beaded 3-7/8 Inch Traditional Cabinet Pull has classic beauty that will make it a sophisticated addition to any home. It has 3-1/2 Inch center to center mounts. It comes packaged with screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-PCT350-size.gif?v=1704354604\" width=\"499\" height=\"186\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PCT350 3.5\" Decorative Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/3-inch-traditional-beaded-cabinet-handle-deltana-pct300\"><b>3\" Decorative Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/traditional-4-inch-cabinet-handle-deltana-pct400\"><b>4\" Decorative Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana PCT350 Decorative Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3-1/2\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PCT350.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PCT350 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
