                "title": "Beaded 3-1/2 Inch Traditional Cabinet Pull | Deltana PCT350",
                "description": "3-1/2 Inch Decorative Cabinet Handle Deltana PCT350 - Deltana's Beaded 3-7/8 Inch Traditional Cabinet Pull has classic beauty that will make it a sophisticated addition to any home. It has 3-1/2 Inch center to center mounts. It comes packaged with screws for easy installation. Available in 9 decorative finishes. \r\n",
